# Live Text bar. Check in each look. Needs tesseract in the sandbox (else only the missing state can be checked). Bottom bar y: Glass 953, Material 947; bar starts x Glass 280, Material 301.
setup (magick -size 1600x900 xc:white -fill black -pointsize 48 -annotate +100+200 "Invoice total 42.00" -annotate +100+320 "https://example.com/pay" /tmp/t.png || convert -size 1600x900 xc:white -fill black -pointsize 48 -annotate +100+200 "Invoice total 42.00" -annotate +100+320 "https://example.com/pay" /tmp/t.png); cp /tmp/t.png /tmp/t2.png
ipc shotEditor edit /tmp/t.png
wait 1
rec lt-read 3 key -k s
note "Finding text..." with a spinner (Material 20 px primary indicator, Glass 16 px), then "Drag across text to select it" with a chip "example.com/pay"; compare the time of the first ready frame QML vs Rust.
wait 1
shot lt-ready
note Bar shows message "Drag across text to select it" and the link chip right after it (about x 560 Glass); if tesseract is missing: "Text recognition needs Tesseract" plus an Install Tesseract button.
ptr glide 560 953 200
wait 1
shot lt-chip-hover
note Chip hovered with the tooltip "Open in your browser" after about 800 ms.
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
wait 1
shot lt-chip-after-selectall
note After Ctrl+A the message changes to "N words selected" and the chip hover/tooltip must STAY (Rust lost them before the fix; QML keeps them).
ptr move 800 953 sleep 200
wait 1
shot lt-copy
note Click "Copy text" (the pointer click may not register on layer surfaces): message "Text copied" with a check for 2 s then "N words selected"; wl-paste then shows the text.
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot lt-copy-all
note Selection cleared; the bar offers "Copy all text"; clicking it shows "All text copied".
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
setup magick -size 800x600 xc:gray /tmp/blank.png
ipc shotEditor edit /tmp/blank.png
wait 1
key -k s
wait 3
shot lt-none
note Plain picture: "No text found in this picture" with no chips.
# MANUAL: Copy text then wl-paste in the sandbox shows the picture's text
# MANUAL: Missing state: "Text recognition needs Tesseract" + Install Tesseract (only if tesseract can be hidden in the sandbox)
